`})}),`
`,r.jsxs(e.p,{children:["The server-side shortcode output places the URL in a ",r.jsx(e.code,{children:"data-pdf-src"})," attribute. Client-side code then passes that value to the bundled PDFObject library, where it was inserted into markup using string concatenation. This second rendering step could turn encoded quote characters back into an attribute-breaking payload."]}),`
