`,r.jsx(e.p,{children:"In a real engagement the graph will branch. Multiple identities on one host, alternate paths to the same target, dead ends. The Graph plugin draws this as a force directed layout where root nodes naturally cluster and any high traffic identity (the user whose credentials are reused everywhere) ends up as a visible hub."}),`
