`,r.jsxs(e.li,{children:["Backlinks are free. Every time you mention ",r.jsx(e.code,{children:"[[root@10.10.10.20]]"})," in a new note, the existing node grows a backlink without you doing anything. After two hours you have a network of references you never had to maintain."]}),`
