`,r.jsxs(e.p,{children:[r.jsx(e.strong,{children:"Research note:"})," I independently encountered and reproduced this behaviour while auditing sudo 1.9.17p2. The issue and its upstream fix were already public by the time of this write-up; I am not claiming original discovery. The exact first affected release has not been established here, so this post deliberately does not claim that every earlier sudo release is vulnerable."]}),`
