`,r.jsxs(e.p,{children:["The issue is not specific to ",r.jsx(e.code,{children:"true"}),". That binary makes a clean demonstration because it takes no arguments and has no side effects. Other regex-authorised commands may be affected when the attacker can supply the same basename through a canonicalising, user-controlled path."]}),`
