`,r.jsxs(e.p,{children:["That distinction also explains why calling this “the ",r.jsx(e.code,{children:"/bin/true"})," bug” is misleading. ",r.jsx(e.code,{children:"/usr/bin/true"})," is just the sample authorised command; command-path identity is the security boundary that failed."]}),`
